# .dockerignore — build-context exclusions for the ClusterFuzzLite fuzz image.
#
# .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile builds with the context rooted at the repo root
# and runs `COPY . $SRC/council`. Without this file that copy would bake the
# ENTIRE tree — .git history, local .env / secret material, Council SQLite
# databases, editor/OS junk, .worktrees/, and build output — into the published
# fuzz image (secret-exposure + bloat). Docker reads this file from the
# build-context root, so it filters exactly what `COPY .` sends.
#
# This is a DENY-LIST: it names what to EXCLUDE and never uses a `*` allow-list,
# so the inputs the fuzz build compiles from can't be accidentally dropped.
# Those inputs stay INCLUDED: the root package.json (read by build.sh for the
# pinned tsc version), the whole .clusterfuzzlite/ dir (build.sh,
# tsconfig.fuzz.json, package.json, fuzz_*.js) and
# packages/cli/src/cli/{strip-control-chars,hidden-format-chars}.ts.
# node_modules is excluded on purpose — build.sh installs typescript and
# Jazzer.js into isolated temp dirs and never uses committed node_modules.
#
# Keep roughly in sync with .gitignore.

# --- Version control metadata (not needed to compile the fuzz targets) ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# --- Dependencies (rebuilt in-container by build.sh; never copied in) ---
**/node_modules

# --- Build / transpile / coverage output (regenerated; never a build input) ---
**/dist
**/dist-fuzz
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vitest-cache
.copilot-coverage-out
.lighthouseci

# --- Worktrees & agent scratch (may hold other branches' trees / secrets) ---
.worktrees
.agent-backup

# --- Local env / secret material — MUST never enter the image ---
.env
.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
*.local
secrets
.npmrc

# --- Council runtime data (local SQLite databases can hold user content) ---
.council
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# --- Logs ---
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- Editor / OS junk ---
.vscode
.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Agent / Sentinel / CI scratch not needed by the fuzz compile ---
.sentinel
.sentinel-*.patch
.sentinel-*.log
.impeccable
.copilot
local-docs

# --- CI / container config the fuzz compile does not read ---
.github
.dockerignore
